<mxCell id="tqc5" value="Experiment &lt;b&gt;/Shared/Experiment/qualibot_chat_traces&lt;/b&gt;, 1 trace per turn.&lt;br&gt;Spans: retrieval (rewrite, search ×N, citation_lookup, passages_sent) · answer (queue_wait, call_1…, time to first token) · persist.&lt;br&gt;Tags read by the scorers; the prompt versions used are linked." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="tqc4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="30" width="400" height="137" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
